{
  "comment": [
    "The concurrency table of design spec 10.4, one entry per row (plan Task 21), plus row 7 with its",
    "roles swapped (set-remove-add, Task 21 fix round 1), the counted set blind adds (counted-set-",
    "blind-adds, plan Task 22: the counter-transform merge, D26) and 12 further counted set cases",
    "(cs-*, Task 22 review: clamping, removes, replace, read-modify, mixed numbers), and the two concurrent",
    "addIndex: cases of indexed queries plan Task 4b (index-add-*). Every case runs two",
    "transactions, A and B, interleaved as plan call C12 orders them: start A, start B, commit B,",
    "commit A. A side runs its steps when it starts and commits later; its outcome is 'committed' or",
    "the class of the error its steps or its commit signalled, with protoBaseST's names (PB...).",
    "setup runs in one transaction on a new database 'cc' (or, with the step ['vector database'],",
    "on a copy of the conformance database vector, whose database is 'db'). The steps:",
    "  ['read root', r]                     get the root r (records its token, absence included)",
    "  ['set root', r, v]                   set the root r to v; in setup, v may be",
    "                                       {'dict': {k: v}}, {'list': [v]}, {'set': [e]} or",
    "                                       {'counted set': [e]}",
    "  ['blind dict set root', r, k, v]     set r to a new Dictionary {k: v}, r unread (merges)",
    "  ['blind dict add index', r, k, v, i] set r to a new Dictionary {k: v} with an EqualityIndex named",
    "                                       i on the path 'v', r unread (merges: the index is added",
    "                                       to the current value, PBConflictError when it has one)",
    "  ['replace', r, k, v]                 set r to a new Dictionary {k: v} with replace: true",
    "  ['list set', r, v]                   set r to a new List [v], r unread",
    "  ['set add', r, e], ['set remove', r, e]",
    "                                       set r to a new Set with e added (removed), r unread",
    "  ['counted set ops', r, mode, op1, e1, op2, e2, ...]",
    "                                       apply add (or remove) of e1, then op2 of e2, ..., to a",
    "                                       CountedSet and set r to it: mode 'blind' starts from a",
    "                                       new one, r unread (merges by the counter transform, D26);",
    "                                       'read' from the value of r (a read-modify-write); 'replace'",
    "                                       from a new one, written with replace: true",
    "  ['new mutable', m, v], ['set mutable', m, v], ['remove mutable', m]",
    "                                       the mutable-cell operations (set and remove blind)",
    "  ['reuse committed', r, k1, v1, k2, v2]",
    "                                       before the side's transaction starts, commit r as a new",
    "                                       Dictionary {k1: v1} (a blind write); then, in the",
    "                                       transaction, set r to that committed value with k2 -> v2",
    "expected holds ProtoBase's outcome (the reference) and the final contents of the roots and",
    "cells listed in roots and mutables, and the index names of the roots listed in indexes (sorted,",
    "comma-separated), in the dump notation of py_case.py and _case_ops.st:",
    "absent, 1, 'text', {'k': v} (sorted keys), [v], #{e} (sorted), #{e: n} for a CountedSet (element",
    "and count, sorted), <object> for a DBObject.",
    "Every case must give the reference with protoST as A, with Python as A and with two protoST",
    "actors: no case records a difference (the runners refuse a 'protobasest' entry; the last one,",
    "indexed-root, was removed when plan Task 4b made merges onto indexed currents as ProtoBase's)."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "read-write-one-root",
      "row": "Both read and write one root",
      "setup": [["set root", "x", 1]],
      "a": [["read root", "x"], ["set root", "x", "A"]],
      "b": [["read root", "x"], ["set root", "x", "B"]],
      "roots": ["x"], "mutables": [],
      "expected": {"outcome": "A=PBConflictError B=committed", "dump": ["root x = 'B'"]}
    },
    {
      "id": "different-roots",
      "row": "Each writes a different root",
      "setup": [["set root", "x", 1], ["set root", "y", 1]],
      "a": [["set root", "x", "A"]],
      "b": [["set root", "y", "B"]],
      "roots": ["x", "y"], "mutables": [],
      "expected": {"outcome": "A=committed B=committed", "dump": ["root x = 'A'", "root y = 'B'"]}
    },
    {
      "id": "blind-dict-different-keys",
      "row": "Blind writes of different keys to one Dictionary root, each built empty",
      "setup": [["set root", "d", {"dict": {"s": 0}}]],
      "a": [["blind dict set root", "d", "ka", 1]],
      "b": [["blind dict set root", "d", "kb", 2]],
      "roots": ["d"], "mutables": [],
      "expected": {"outcome": "A=committed B=committed", "dump": ["root d = {'ka': 1, 'kb': 2, 's': 0}"]}
    },
    {
      "id": "blind-dict-same-key",
      "row": "Blind writes of the same key",
      "setup": [["set root", "d", {"dict": {"s": 0}}]],
      "a": [["blind dict set root", "d", "k", "A"]],
      "b": [["blind dict set root", "d", "k", "B"]],
      "roots": ["d"], "mutables": [],
      "expected": {"outcome": "A=committed B=committed", "dump": ["root d = {'k': 'A', 's': 0}"]}
    },
    {
      "id": "blind-replace",
      "row": "Blind write with replace: true",
      "setup": [["set root", "d", {"dict": {"s": 0}}]],
      "a": [["replace", "d", "ka", 1]],
      "b": [["blind dict set root", "d", "kb", 2]],
      "roots": ["d"], "mutables": [],
      "expected": {"outcome": "A=committed B=committed", "dump": ["root d = {'ka': 1}"]}
    },
    {
      "id": "blind-list",
      "row": "A blind write of a List",
      "setup": [["set root", "l", {"list": [0]}]],
      "a": [["list set", "l", "A"]],
      "b": [["list set", "l", "B"]],
      "roots": ["l"], "mutables": [],
      "expected": {"outcome": "A=committed B=committed", "dump": ["root l = ['A']"]}
    },
    {
      "id": "set-add-remove",
      "row": "A blind Set add and a concurrent remove of the same element",
      "setup": [["set root", "s", {"set": ["e", "f"]}]],
      "a": [["set add", "s", "e"]],
      "b": [["set remove", "s", "e"]],
      "roots": ["s"], "mutables": [],
      "expected": {"outcome": "A=committed B=committed", "dump": ["root s = #{'e', 'f'}"]}
    },
    {
      "id": "set-remove-add",
      "row": "A blind Set add and a concurrent remove of the same element (the roles swapped: an unlogged remove would leave e)",
      "setup": [["set root", "s", {"set": ["e", "f"]}]],
      "a": [["set remove", "s", "e"]],
      "b": [["set add", "s", "e"]],
      "roots": ["s"], "mutables": [],
      "expected": {"outcome": "A=committed B=committed", "dump": ["root s = #{'f'}"]}
    },
    {
      "id": "counted-set-blind-adds",
      "row": "Counted set blind adds: concurrent increments of one element, each built empty (D26)",
      "setup": [["set root", "c", {"counted set": ["e", "e", "f"]}]],
      "a": [["counted set ops", "c", "blind", "add", "e", "add", "e"]],
      "b": [["counted set ops", "c", "blind", "add", "e", "add", "g"]],
      "roots": ["c"], "mutables": [],
      "expected": {"outcome": "A=committed B=committed", "dump": ["root c = #{'e': 5, 'f': 1, 'g': 1}"]}
    },
    {
      "id": "cs-clamp-before-adds",
      "row": "Counted set: a blind remove x3 then add, while the other reads and adds e twice (removes clamp at 0 before the adds)",
      "setup": [["set root", "c", {"counted set": ["e", "e", "f"]}]],
      "a": [["counted set ops", "c", "blind", "remove", "e", "remove", "e", "remove", "e", "add", "e"]],
      "b": [["counted set ops", "c", "read", "add", "e", "add", "e"]],
      "roots": ["c"], "mutables": [],
      "expected": {"outcome": "A=committed B=committed", "dump": ["root c = #{'e': 2, 'f': 1}"]}
    },
    {
      "id": "cs-clamp-onto-blind",
      "row": "Counted set: a blind remove x3 then add, while the other blindly adds e",
      "setup": [["set root", "c", {"counted set": ["e", "e", "f"]}]],
      "a": [["counted set ops", "c", "blind", "remove", "e", "remove", "e", "remove", "e", "add", "e"]],
      "b": [["counted set ops", "c", "blind", "add", "e"]],
      "roots": ["c"], "mutables": [],
      "expected": {"outcome": "A=committed B=committed", "dump": ["root c = #{'e': 1, 'f': 1}"]}
    },
    {
      "id": "cs-concurrent-removes",
      "row": "Counted set: concurrent blind removes of one element, past its count",
      "setup": [["set root", "c", {"counted set": ["e", "e", "f"]}]],
      "a": [["counted set ops", "c", "blind", "remove", "e"]],
      "b": [["counted set ops", "c", "blind", "remove", "e", "remove", "e"]],
      "roots": ["c"], "mutables": [],
      "expected": {"outcome": "A=committed B=committed", "dump": ["root c = #{'f': 1}"]}
    },
    {
      "id": "cs-remove-absent-vs-add",
      "row": "Counted set: a blind remove of an absent element while the other adds it",
      "setup": [["set root", "c", {"counted set": ["e", "e", "f"]}]],
      "a": [["counted set ops", "c", "blind", "remove", "z"]],
      "b": [["counted set ops", "c", "blind", "add", "z"]],
